---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b-2 border-dark bg-white px-4 py-20 md:px-8">
  <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 opacity-10">
    <Icon name="Blocks" class="h-64 w-64" />
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="neo-card relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-center border-dark bg-brand-blue p-8 text-center text-white md:p-12">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Tentang Krespace</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">Krespace Studio adalah studio digital kecil yang membantu membuat website dan sistem sederhana untuk kebutuhan bisnis, operasional, dan administrasi.</p>
      <p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed text-blue-100">Kami fokus membantu client yang ingin mulai merapikan proses kerja, terutama yang masih banyak bergantung pada Excel, WhatsApp, atau pencatatan manual.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <span class="neo-badge border-dark bg-brand-green px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white">Simple</span>
        <span class="neo-badge border-dark bg-brand-purple px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white">Custom</span>
        <span class="neo-badge border-dark bg-brand-orange px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white">Web-based</span>
        <span class="neo-badge border-white bg-dark px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white">Easy to use</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
